{"type":"text","timestamp":1794544467587,"sessionID":"ses_e2cd274d8ffe8RLmf2Xovov7Zy","part":{"id":"prt_1d32f726a001hduyEVtzGgfYAy","sessionID":"ses_e2cd274d8ffe8RLmf2Xovov7Zy","messageID":"msg_1d32f552f001WDlw3WLEr6rgIO","type":"text","text":"T002 complete. All four files are on disk and the task's Verify command printed every expected value.\n\n**Files written** (all under `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/013-attribution-and-install-reach/scratch/`):\n- `summary-post-before.json`\n- `summary-pre-before.json`\n- `summary-g2-before.json`\n- `delivery-before.txt`\n\n**Verify output**\n\n```\n$ jq -r 'keys | join(\",\")' $SP/summary-post-before.json\nclaude,codex,devin,dsh,opencode,pi\n\n$ rg -c '\"b\":\"unknown\"' $SP/delivery-before.txt\n5\n\n$ rg -c '^present ' $SP/delivery-before.txt\n6\n\n$ tail -1 $SP/delivery-before.txt\nWARN codex-hooks-unapproved /private/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/skilled-behaviour-arenas/post-codex\n```\n\nThe four expectations hold: the key list names the six runtimes, five arms read `unknown` for delivery (Codex, Devin, DSH, OpenCode, Pi; Claude reads `true`), all six arena directories are present, and the last line starts with `WARN codex-hooks-unapproved`.\n\nThe three summary runs exited 0 and each file parses with exactly six runtime keys.\n\n**Nothing blocked.** No arena was missing, so nothing needed recording for T033. I did not tick the checkbox in `tasks.md`, touched no repository file outside `scratch/`, and ran no git state-changing command. `REPO RULES: evidence-and-proof.md, communication.md` loaded for the write and the report.","time":{"start":1794544464490,"end":1794544467587}}}
